%chk=probe_ch2_rohf_iop_rhfwin.chk
%mem=2GB
%nprocshared=1
#P ROHF/6-31G NoSymm Int=NoBasisTransform SCF=(Conver=10)
# Output=(MatrixElement,MO2ElectronIntegrals) Tran=(Full,Force) Window=(2,13) IOp(8/40=2)

probe_ch2_rohf_iop_rhfwin: probe_ch2_rohf (IOp(8/40=2) alone). Tests whether
IOp(8/5) (1 = do not pseudo-canonicalize ROHF orbitals) and IOp(8/40) (2 =
treat the ROHF window as RHF, transforming only the alpha orbitals) make
Gaussian transform over the ROHF orbitals themselves. Without them (the M0
probes) TRANS MO COEFFICIENTS were per-spin semicanonical and g16dump extract
refused the file. SUCCESS: TRANS MO COEFFICIENTS equal the active ROHF MOs, so
extract --reference ROHF accepts it, and validate shows h' alpha/beta
agreement and E_ref = E(SCF).

0 3
C   0.0000000   0.0000000   0.1900000
H   0.0000000   0.9900000  -0.5600000
H   0.0000000  -0.9900000  -0.5600000

probe_ch2_rohf_iop_rhfwin.mat

